{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has at least once thought about what happens to those whom we leave alone. Will you be able to cope with yourself as a loner? Will you cause the death of an innocent girl?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.poster.avif?t=1768360820\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.webm?t=1768360820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.mp4?t=1768360820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aftershock is a first\u2014person adventure game. You will take on the role of a combat veteran who has been dragged into the abyss of his psychological trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wounded by his military past, Nikolai experiences the same pain every day. Memories of the past are intertwined with the present, creating distorted images. The boundary between the house and the battlefield is blurred. You have to make decisions that will determine different endings. The game has elements of non-linearity and interactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong psychological undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, the one ray of sunshine in this wretched cage\u2014Olechka!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1768360820\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras_big/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1768360820 width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486500?t=1768360820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486500?t=1768360820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/eb6bdc612c3b8abed73c917aa5ec9b2f45c7d46a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768360820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/eb6bdc612c3b8abed73c917aa5ec9b2f45c7d46a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768360820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Warning!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains scenes of violence, sudden flashes of light, unexpected sound effects, and psychologically intense moments that may cause fear, anxiety, or panic attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have heart problems, epilepsy, or other conditions related to light sensitivity and stress, it is strongly advised to refrain from playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with caution. Your health comes first!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has at least once thought about what happens to those whom we leave alone. Will you be able to cope with yourself as a loner? Will you cause the death of an innocent girl?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.poster.avif?t=1768360820\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.webm?t=1768360820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.mp4?t=1768360820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aftershock is a first\u2014person adventure game. You will take on the role of a combat veteran who has been dragged into the abyss of his psychological trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wounded by his military past, Nikolai experiences the same pain every day. Memories of the past are intertwined with the present, creating distorted images. The boundary between the house and the battlefield is blurred. You have to make decisions that will determine different endings. The game has elements of non-linearity and interactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong psychological undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, the one ray of sunshine in this wretched cage\u2014Olechka!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1768360820\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras_big/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1768360820 width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["SeaPrim"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id"